# issue: none
# notes: 64 docs: 61 closer ineligible decoys and three eligible vectors at squared L2 distances 5, 8 and 13. The exact winners cannot come from post-filtering global top three.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 60000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Doc { slug: String @key status: String embedding: Vector(4) @index }

